      "created_at": "2016-11-30T10:32:25Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-11-30T10:32:25Z",
      "body": "In Responsive News cucumber suite they do:\r\n```ruby\r\npage.driver.set_cookie('ckns_policy', '001',  domain: 'bbc.com')\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt seems that if the terminal xpath output is not the same as viewing the page in the browser then something is different on multiple visits to the page. Catharine suggested the xpath seems to get stuck on the cookie banner which indicates this differs on multiple page visits. A lot of the News testing tools set the cookie before checking the page, so we get a consistent experience.",
